# Shared by Dockerfile.api and Dockerfile.web — both build with the repo root
# as context. Everything excluded here is either rebuilt inside the image
# (bin/obj, node_modules, dist), never belongs in one (git history, agent
# worktrees), or is simply dead weight for a publish (tests).
.git
.github
.claude
**/bin
**/obj
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/coverage
tests
# Local secrets / env files must never enter a build context, even ignored
# ones — web/.env.example is the documented exception (it holds no values).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!web/.env.example
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
